{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55400","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 佛教（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「演教」） · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 佛教（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「演教」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三时次第演金言，三世如来亦共宣。\n初说有空人皆执，後非空有衆皆缘（《偈颂》作「捐」）。\n龙宫满藏（《偈颂》作「字」）医方义，鹤树终谈理未玄。\n真净界中才一念，阎浮早已八千年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}